    "East rail network: row-2 line x16..22 + south spurs ONLY at even columns (16->y3, 18->y4, 20->y5, 22->y4); odd columns 17/19/21 verified spur-less; no rail touches the east peg (22,6) or any neighbor; the four east carriers are interchangeable and block each other.",
    "Movement grammar (from the banked L6 tail): pieces move by leapfrog PAIR jumps -- click source, click landing 2 away over one occupied cell, alternating partners; carriers are mobile landing cells; the camera follows a CARGO-LOADED carrier (that is how L6's hidden chamber was revealed after 13 E presses).",
